cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using
  the metadata provided in this file.
type: software
title: Autonomous Robotic Visual Inspection (RVI)
authors:
  - family-names: Pomianek
    given-names: Mateusz
repository-code: https://github.com/MatPomGit/arc-rvi
url: https://matpomgit.github.io/arc-rvi/
version: 1.22.2
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Research software for reproducible robotic visual inspection.
  The current implementation provides offline, hardware-independent
  tools and synthetic evaluations for target localization, viewpoint
  planning, coverage estimation and image-quality assessment.
  Physical robot integration and confirmatory validation are not implemented.
keywords:
  - autonomous robotic visual inspection
  - robotics
  - viewpoint planning
  - simulation
  - reproducible research
